# Unwilling Vessel: "When this creature dies, create an X/X blue Spirit creature token with flying, where X is the number of counters
# on this creature" counts counters of every kind as it last existed (CR 608.2h; its ruling: the -1/-1 counters that killed it count
# too). Bot1's Flood on turn 3 gives it a possession counter, then Bot1's own Darkness Descends puts two -1/-1 counters on it: a 3/2
# with them is a 1/0 and dies with three counters, so the Spirit is 3/3 (one counting only possession counters would make a 1/1).

